{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, u(n)/2^n)\n  converges absolutely: ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1/2 < 1\n  = 1\n  method: geometric series a r^lo/(1 - r)\n  numeric: 1 (60 terms (the ratio of terms -> 1/2; Aitken's delta^2 agrees); estimated error 1e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "infinite_sum", "ucas": "sum(n, 1, inf, H(n)/2^n)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "infinite_sum", "converges_absolutely": "ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1/2 < 1", "value": "1", "value_int": 1, "method": "geometric series a r^lo/(1 - r)", "numeric": "1 (60 terms (the ratio of terms -> 1/2; Aitken's delta^2 agrees); estimated error 1e-16)", "headline": "sum(n, 1, inf, u(n)/2^n)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "check", "passed": true, "text": "the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 0)"}], "files": [], "text": "sum(n, 1, inf, u(n)/2^n)\n  converges absolutely: ratio test: |a_(n+1)/a_n| -> 1/2 < 1\n  = 1\n  method: geometric series a r^lo/(1 - r)\n  numeric: 1 (60 terms (the ratio of terms -> 1/2; Aitken's delta^2 agrees); estimated error 1e-16)\n  check: the closed form and the numeric value agree (difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
